New algorithm: Prioritize bins by the ratio of item size to bin capacity, preferring bins where the item fits and the ratio is largest (most filling), and assign lowest priority to bins where the item does not fit.
}

{
New algorithm: For each bin, compute the ratio of the item size to the bin's remaining capacity after adding the item, then prioritize bins where this ratio is largest among bins that can still fit the item.
}

{
New algorithm: Prioritize bins based on the ratio of the item size to the bin's current capacity, preferring bins where the item fits and this ratio is largest (i.e., the item uses a high proportion of remaining space), while heavily penalizing bins where the item does not fit.
}

